:: Nightmare Bailey
<<effects>><<nightmareStart "bailey">>
<<endevent>>
<<generate1>><<person1>>
<<set $NPCList[0].description to "shadowed">>
<<set $NPCList[0].name_known to 0>>
<<npc "Bailey" 2>><<person2>>

You try to sleep. It doesn't come. The flat is eerily quiet even though it's normally filled with sounds. Your heart speeds up. You try to get up, <span class="red">but you realise you can't move.</span><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

Only your eyes still obey you. You open them and glance over.
<br><br>

Bailey's eyes are wide open. <<Hes>> watching you. You think <<he>> looks annoyed with you.
<br><br>

<<if $nightmaresSeen.includes("bailey")>>
	Something's wrong. You've seen this before. <span class="purple">It isn't real.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Wake up|Nightmare Bailey Wake]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<nightmareWakeDifficulty>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Say something|Nightmare Bailey 2]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Shut your eyes|Nightmare Bailey 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>


:: Nightmare Bailey Wake
<<effects>><<person2>>

<<if $phase is 2>>
	You tell yourself that none of this is real. When you wake up, you'll be in Bailey's bed. You shut your eyes and focus.
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	The chains are only ink. You know where they belong. You picture the serpent still and flat against Bailey's chest.
<<else>>
	Fear crawls up the back of your mind. You push it down. Rent isn't due. Bailey won't sell you, not unless you did something to deserve it.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	Your body twitches. <span class="green">You've managed to wrestle some control back,</span> just enough to open your mouth.
	<br><br>

	A piercing scream leaves your lips.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Nightmare Bailey Wake 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<set $nightmareWake++>>
	<<if $phase is 2>>
		You try to hold onto the bedroom. It stretches thin in your mind, <span class="red">the room bleeds into the dusty tunnels beneath the orphanage.</span>
		<br><br>

		The shadow at the end of the tunnel is there, waiting.<<stress 12>><<ggstress>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Nightmare Bailey Molestation]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		<span class="red">Something cold slides across your ankle,</span> shattering the picture. Your eyes snap open. The ink is already off <<his>> skin and wrapping around yours.<<stress 6>><<gstress>><<bindtemp>><<legbind>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Nightmare Bailey 3]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		Even with your eyes closed, you feel <<his>> stare. <span class="red">You can't block it out.</span><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
		You hear <<him>> move.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Nightmare Bailey 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Nightmare Bailey 2
<<effects>><<person2>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	You squeeze your eyes shut. It doesn't help. You can still feel Bailey watching you.
<<else>>
	You try to speak. Your jaw won't open. The words pile up behind your teeth.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey reaches over and takes hold of your arm. <<His>> grip is tight and painful.<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

The tattooed serpent hisses across <<his>> skin as it moves. It lifts off <<his>> chest and arms and slides off <<his>> skin and onto yours, winding around your wrists and your ankles, <span class="red">turning to chains.</span><<bindtemp>><<legbind>>
<br><br>

<span class="bailey-red">"Rent's due, brat. Or did you forget?"</span> <<he>> snarls. <span class="bailey-stockholm">"You're not going anywhere."</span>
<br><br>

<<if $nightmaresSeen.includes("bailey")>>
	<<link [[Wake up|Nightmare Bailey Wake]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<nightmareWakeDifficulty>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Struggle|Nightmare Bailey 3]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Go limp|Nightmare Bailey 3]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>


:: Nightmare Bailey 3
<<effects>><<person2>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	You strain against the chains. They don't give. They seem to go tighter with every breath.
<<else>>
	You go limp. The chains keep winding around you.
<</if>>
<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

The bedroom stretches. The walls run long and narrow and the air turns damp and dusty. You know these tunnels. Bailey walked you through them with a hood placed over your head and ropes tied around your wrists.
<br><br>

"I told you. I'll extract value from you if I have to," <<he>> says to you.

Bailey stands, lifting you off the bed by the chains like cargo. At the end of the tunnel, a <<= $NPCList[0].gender is "m" ? "man" : "woman">>-shaped shadow waits. Bailey carries you towards it.
<br><br>

The shadow holds out a handful of notes. Bailey sets you on your knees in front of the shadow before <<he>> takes the money and counts them. <<He>> isn't in any hurry, taking <<his>> time to count the money twice.
<br><br>

"Pleasure doing business with you."
<br><br>

<<if $nightmaresSeen.includes("bailey")>>
	<<link [[Wake up|Nightmare Bailey Wake]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<nightmareWakeDifficulty>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Scream|Nightmare Bailey Molestation]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Reach for Bailey|Nightmare Bailey Molestation]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>


:: Nightmare Bailey Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<clearsinglenpc 1>>
	<<person1>>
	<<set $trance to 1>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemyanger to 70>>
	<<set $enemytrust to 0>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		You try to reach for Bailey. The chains won't let you. <<nnpc_He "Bailey">> doesn't look up from <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> counting.
	<<else>>
		You open your mouth to scream. Nothing comes out. The shadow takes the chains. Bailey doesn't look up from the money.
	<</if>>
	The client lays <<his>> hands on you. They're cold and dreadful.
	<<controlloss>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $enemypleasuremax to 250 * ($npcArousalMult / 100)>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Nightmare Bailey Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Nightmare Bailey Molestation]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>


:: Nightmare Bailey Molestation Finish
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<set $pronoun to $NPCList[0].pronoun>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].intro to 1>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	The <<person>> releases you, satisfied. The chains around your wrists slacken.
<<else>>
	The <<person>> loses its grip on you, unravelling into the dark. The chains around your wrists slacken.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You watch as the chains slide off your skin, freeing you at last.<<unbindtemp>> They turn to snakes and slither down the tunnel, up Bailey's arm, and settle flat across <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> arms and chest. It's just a tattoo again. You can't take your eyes off it.
<br><br>

The dark folds in.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Nightmare Bailey End]]>><<endcombat>><<clotheson>><</link>>
<br>


:: Nightmare Bailey End
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<unfreezePlayerStats>>
<<run $nightmaresSeen.pushUnique("bailey")>>
<<set $baileyNightmareRestless to true>>
<<unset $nightmareNext>><<unset $activeNightmare>><<unset $nightmareRedirect>><<unset $nightmareExit>>
<<npc "Bailey">><<person1>>

Your eyes open to the abstract snakes trailing across the ceiling of Bailey's bedroom. The flats outside hum with life.
<br><br>

Bailey is asleep beside you, breathing slow and even. <<His>> shirt collar has shifted in <<his>> sleep. The tattoo peeking out from underneath <<his>> collar doesn't move.
<br><br>

You think about how the same hands that rest against your skin now once put you in ropes and a hood and marched you to someone willing to pay for you. <<Hes>> sold you before, and you know for certain that <<he>>'ll sell you again if you fail to pay up.<<stress 18>><<gggstress>>
<br><br>

You're too shaken and tired to move away from <<him>>. Eventually, sheer exhaustion pulls you back towards an uneasy sleep. 
<br><br>

<<link [[Sleep|Bailey Date All Night Morning]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Nightmare Bailey Wake 2
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<unfreezePlayerStats>>
<<run $nightmaresSeen.pushUnique("bailey")>>
<<set $baileyNightmareRestless to true>>
<<unset $nightmareNext>><<unset $activeNightmare>><<unset $nightmareRedirect>><<unset $nightmareExit>>
<<npc "Bailey">><<person1>>

You wake up, screaming until you're out of breath. You turn your head and see Bailey already awake, propped on one elbow, watching you with a frown.
<br><br>

"Noisy little shit," <<he>> mutters, indifferent to your nightmare.
<br><br>

You eye the tattoo peeking beneath <<his>> shirt collar. It isn't moving.
<br><br>

"Go back to sleep, brat. Nobody's taking you." <<His>> hand lands on your sternum and pushes you back down, flat. It stays there, pressed against your heartbeat.<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Go back to sleep|Nightmare Bailey Sleep]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 2>>
	<<link [[Hold <<him>>|Nightmare Bailey Sleep]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><</link>><<glove "Bailey">>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Nightmare Bailey Sleep
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	You turn into <<him>>, pressing your face against <<his>> chest, right against the ink. You wrap your arms around <<him>>. <<He>> doesn't push you away. <<His>> hand moves from your sternum to your back, resting there.
	<br><br>
	You fall asleep to the sound of <<his>> steady heartbeat. <<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	You close your eyes. <<His>> hand stays where it is, heavy on your sternum, measuring your heartbeat until your breathing evens out.
	<br><br>
	Sleep takes you again.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Sleep|Bailey Date All Night Morning]]>><</link>>
<br>
